{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c27e641-db0e-11ef-bb3e-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c2711e3-db0e-11ef-92ac-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉昫","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘昫","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd25-db0e-11ef-8449-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd26-db0e-11ef-8348-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd27-db0e-11ef-ac6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd28-db0e-11ef-83a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武強","place_name_jianti_auto":"武强","place_note":"河北省武强县","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd29-db0e-11ef-a955-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd2a-db0e-11ef-b03b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武隧縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武隧县","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd2b-db0e-11ef-b13d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間國","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间国","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd2c-db0e-11ef-9dab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd2d-db0e-11ef-85a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武強","place_name_jianti_auto":"武强","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd2e-db0e-11ef-951a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安平國","place_name_jianti_auto":"安平国","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd2f-db0e-11ef-95ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd30-db0e-11ef-988b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣宗郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"广宗郡","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd31-db0e-11ef-905f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武邑郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"武邑郡","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd32-db0e-11ef-9d21-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd33-db0e-11ef-91f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武強縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武强县","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd34-db0e-11ef-bfcd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd35-db0e-11ef-a02b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信都郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"信都郡","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd36-db0e-11ef-a462-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"三公郞，自魏、晉以來有之。五代志：後齊尚書列曹，三公郞中屬殿中尚書，掌五時讀時令、諸曹囚帳、斷罪、赦日建金雞等事。劉昫曰：武強，漢武隧縣，屬河間國；晉改曰武強，屬安平國；後魏屬廣宗郡，又置武邑郡。五代志曰：齊廢郡爲武強縣，至隋，屬信都郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"三公郞，自魏、晋以来有之。五代志：后齐尚书列曹，三公郞中属殿中尚书，掌五时读时令、诸曹囚帐、断罪、赦日建金鸡等事。刘昫曰：武强，汉武隧县，属河间国；晋改曰武强，属安平国；后魏属广宗郡，又置武邑郡。五代志曰：齐废郡为武强县，至隋，属信都郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd24-db0e-11ef-9d8a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"府设广阿【河北省隆尧县】","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd40-db0e-11ef-9dda-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"帝旣殘忍，有司訊囚，莫不嚴酷，或燒犂耳，使立其上，或燒車釭，使以臂貫之，旣不勝苦，皆至誣伏。唯三公郞中武強蘇瓊，歷職中外，所至皆以寬平爲治。時趙州及清河屢有人告謀反者，前後皆付瓊推檢，事多申雪。尚書崔昂謂瓊曰：「若欲立功名，當更思餘理；數雪反逆，身命何輕！」瓊正色曰：「所雪者冤枉耳，不縱反逆也。」昂大慙。","content_fanyi":"高洋性情残忍，主管部门的官员审讯囚犯时，没有一个不严酷的；有的烧热犁耳，让囚犯站在上面；有的把车釭烧红，让囚犯把手臂穿进去；囚犯经不住这样的痛苦，都屈打成招。只有三公郎中武强人苏琼，历任朝廷内外官职，所到之处都实行宽厚平和的治理。当时赵州和清河郡多次有人告发谋反的人，前后的案件都交给苏琼调查审理，许多被诬告的人得以申雪。尚书崔昂对苏琼说：“如果想要建立功名，就应当另想别的办法；多次为反叛之人昭雪，把自己的身家性命看得太轻了！”苏琼严肃地说：“我昭雪的只是受冤枉的人，并不是放纵反叛的人。”崔昂非常惭愧。","content_jianti_auto":"帝既残忍，有司讯囚，莫不严酷，或烧犂耳，使立其上，或烧车釭，使以臂贯之，既不胜苦，皆至诬伏。唯三公郞中武强苏琼，历职中外，所至皆以宽平为治。时赵州及清河屡有人告谋反者，前后皆付琼推检，事多申雪。尚书崔昂谓琼曰：「若欲立功名，当更思余理；数雪反逆，身命何轻！」琼正色曰：「所雪者冤枉耳，不纵反逆也。」昂大慙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":15809,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六十七 (陳紀一) / 高祖武皇帝 / 二年 / 第 43 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd21-db0e-11ef-931c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":558},"tongjian_id":"b1c6fd21-db0e-11ef-931c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"湝","people_name_jianti_auto":"湝","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e8f-db0e-11ef-80c4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","place_note":"府设信都【河北省冀州市】","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e90-db0e-11ef-8e34-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信都","place_name_jianti_auto":"信都","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e91-db0e-11ef-b651-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e92-db0e-11ef-854d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信都","place_name_jianti_auto":"信都","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e93-db0e-11ef-8848-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"冀州治信都。湝自河間進兵至信都。珩，音行。任，音壬。湝，古皆翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"冀州治信都。湝自河间进兵至信都。珩，音行。任，音壬。湝，古皆翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e8e-db0e-11ef-ad69-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e95-db0e-11ef-b03a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"定","place_name_jianti_auto":"定","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e96-db0e-11ef-948e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"相","place_name_jianti_auto":"相","place_note":"府邺城","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e97-db0e-11ef-8c3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e98-db0e-11ef-92f6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"广阿","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e99-db0e-11ef-a0e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e9a-db0e-11ef-9e0d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏孝昌二年，分定、相二州置殷州，治廣阿，後改爲趙州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏孝昌二年，分定、相二州置殷州，治广阿，后改为赵州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e94-db0e-11ef-9875-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"憲","people_name_jianti_auto":"宪","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e9d-db0e-11ef-a2d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"湝","people_name_jianti_auto":"湝","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e9e-db0e-11ef-ad81-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","place_note":"首都邺城【河北临漳县西南邺镇】","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e9f-db0e-11ef-ab7a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"齊舊將從憲軍者，集以示諜，以攜湝軍之心。騎，奇寄翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"齐旧将从宪军者，集以示谍，以携湝军之心。骑，奇寄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e9c-db0e-11ef-94bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂諜者當能具言之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓谍者当能具言之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea1-db0e-11ef-a41c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"子玉","people_name_jianti_auto":"子玉","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea3-db0e-11ef-b97f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋侯","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea4-db0e-11ef-8a15-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"城濮","place_name_jianti_auto":"城濮","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea5-db0e-11ef-ae3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea6-db0e-11ef-830a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：城濮之役，楚子玉遣使請戰於晉侯曰：「請與君之士戲，君憑軾而望之。」故引以爲言。兵車之軾，高三尺三寸，立而憑之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：城濮之役，楚子玉遣使请战于晋侯曰：「请与君之士戏，君凭轼而望之。」故引以为言。兵车之轼，高三尺三寸，立而凭之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":185,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea2-db0e-11ef-893c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"湝","people_name_jianti_auto":"湝","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea9-db0e-11ef-8329-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"易·大傳曰：「君子見幾而作，不俟終日，」引以諭湝，使速降。","note_content_jianti_auto":"易·大传曰：「君子见几而作，不俟终日，」引以谕湝，使速降。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"b2f55ea8-db0e-11ef-a6a9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"府设广阿【河北省隆尧县】","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"b2f5facf-db0e-11ef-9b2a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"齊廣寧王孝珩至滄州，以五千人會任城王湝於信都，共謀匡復，召募得四萬餘人。周主使齊王憲、柱國楊堅擊之。令高緯爲手書招湝，湝不從。憲軍至趙州，湝遣二諜覘之，候騎執以白憲。憲集齊舊將，遍示之，謂曰：「吾所爭者大，不在汝曹。今縱汝還，仍充吾使。」乃與湝書曰：「足下諜者爲候騎所拘，軍中情實，具諸執事。戰非上計，無待卜疑；守乃下策，或未相許。已勒諸軍分道並進，相望非遠，憑軾有期。『不俟終日』，所望知機也！」","content_fanyi":"北齐广宁王高孝珩到达沧州，率领五千人在信都与任城王高湝会合，共同谋划恢复北齐，招募到四万余人。北周国主派齐王宇文宪、柱国杨坚进攻他们。又让高纬亲笔写信招降高湝，高湝不肯听从。宇文宪的军队到达赵州，高湝派出两名间谍前去侦察，北周巡逻骑兵将他们擒获并报告宇文宪。宇文宪召集北齐旧将，把两名间谍带来让他们都看到，并对间谍说：“我所要争取的是大计，并不在于你们这些人。现在放你们回去，仍要你们充作我的使者。”于是写信给高湝说：“您的间谍已被我方巡逻骑兵俘获，我军中的实际情形，会由他们向您禀报。交战不是上策，这用不着占卜决疑；固守则是下策，或许您也不会同意。我已部署各军分道并进，彼此相望已经不远，我扶着车轼前来相见也指日可待。所谓‘不俟终日’，就是望您能见机行事。”","content_jianti_auto":"齐广宁王孝珩至沧州，以五千人会任城王湝于信都，共谋匡复，召募得四万余人。周主使齐王宪、柱国杨坚击之。令高纬为手书招湝，湝不从。宪军至赵州，湝遣二谍觇之，候骑执以白宪。宪集齐旧将，遍示之，谓曰：「吾所争者大，不在汝曹。今纵汝还，仍充吾使。」乃与湝书曰：「足下谍者为候骑所拘，军中情实，具诸执事。战非上计，无待卜疑；守乃下策，或未相许。已勒诸军分道并进，相望非远，凭轼有期。『不俟终日』，所望知机也！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16660,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十三 (陳紀七) / 高宗宣皇帝中之下 / 太建九年 / 第 19 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b2f55e8d-db0e-11ef-bc7c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":577},"tongjian_id":"b2f55e8d-db0e-11ef-bc7c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"相，悉亮翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"相，悉亮翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0d6-db0e-11ef-bf0f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"奏課，奏計帳及輸籍也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"奏课，奏计帐及输籍也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0d7-db0e-11ef-bf98-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"城外曰郭。釋名：郭，廓也；廓落在城外也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"城外曰郭。释名：郭，廓也；廓落在城外也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0d8-db0e-11ef-917d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"彥光","people_name_jianti_auto":"彦光","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0dc-db0e-11ef-8163-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔穎達","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔颖达","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0dd-db0e-11ef-9e0b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0de-db0e-11ef-96a0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"餳，飴也。餳軟而甘，言彥光爲人軟美如團餳，特著帽耳。孔穎達曰：凡飴謂之餳，關東之通語也。方言曰：餳謂之張皇，或云滑餹。著，則略翻。餳，徐盈翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"饧，饴也。饧软而甘，言彦光为人软美如团饧，特著帽耳。孔颖达曰：凡饴谓之饧，关东之通语也。方言曰：饧谓之张皇，或云滑餹。著，则略翻。饧，徐盈翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0db-db0e-11ef-a151-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e1-db0e-11ef-90c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大陸縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"大陆县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e2-db0e-11ef-8f47-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"广阿","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e3-db0e-11ef-85cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷州","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e4-db0e-11ef-bbba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南鉅鹿郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南巨鹿郡","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e5-db0e-11ef-9ace-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南趙郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南赵郡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e6-db0e-11ef-9a7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e7-db0e-11ef-a316-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：趙郡大陸縣，舊曰廣阿，置殷州及南鉅鹿郡，後改南趙郡，改州爲趙州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：赵郡大陆县，旧曰广阿，置殷州及南巨鹿郡，后改南赵郡，改州为赵州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0e0-db0e-11ef-9f01-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"彥光","people_name_jianti_auto":"彦光","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0ed-db0e-11ef-92f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"岐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐州","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0ee-db0e-11ef-a916-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史因岐州之政，終言彥光歷刺他州事。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史因岐州之政，终言彦光历刺他州事。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":240,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0ec-db0e-11ef-ac4c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b36aa0d4-db0e-11ef-94ac-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"bì","source_anchor_text":"郭風俗險詖好興謠訟","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":101,"text":"詖","tongjian_id":"b67897b8-534e-507c-ac8b-057b509a9c1a"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"广阿•河北省隆尧县","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":131,"tongjian_id":"b36ceac9-db0e-11ef-9a8f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"岐州刺史安定梁彥光，有惠政，隋主下詔褒美，賜束帛及御傘，以厲天下之吏；久之，徙相州刺史。岐俗質厚，彥光以靜鎭之，奏課連爲天下最。及居相，部如岐州法。鄴自齊亡，衣冠士人多遷入關，唯工商樂戶移實州郭，風俗險詖，好興謠訟，目彥光爲「著帽餳」。帝聞之，免彥光官。歲餘，拜趙州刺史。彥光自請復爲相州，帝許之。豪猾聞彥光再來，皆嗤之。彥光至，發擿姦伏，有若神明，豪猾潛竄，闔境大治。於是招致名儒，每鄕立學，親臨策試，褒勤黜怠。及舉秀才，祖道於郊，以財物資之。於是風化大變，吏民感悅，無復訟者。","content_fanyi":"岐州刺史、安定人梁彦光，有惠政，隋文帝下诏嘉奖他，赏赐束帛和御伞，用来激励天下的官吏；过了一段时间，调任他为相州刺史。岐州民风质朴淳厚，梁彦光以清静无为加以治理，所奏报的户口、垦田、赋税等考课政绩连年居全国第一。到了相州后，他仍照岐州的办法治理。相州治所邺城自从北齐灭亡后，衣冠士族大多迁入关中，只有工匠、商人和乐户迁来充实州城，风俗奸险邪僻，喜欢造谣兴讼，把梁彦光看作“戴帽的饴糖”。隋文帝听说后，免去梁彦光的官职。过了一年多，任命他为赵州刺史。梁彦光自己请求再次出任相州刺史，隋文帝准许了。相州的豪强猾吏听说梁彦光再来，都嗤笑他。梁彦光到任后，揭发奸邪隐秘的案情，审理惩处如有神明，豪强猾吏暗中逃窜，全境大治。于是延请名儒，每乡设立学校，亲自到学中主持考试，奖励勤奋的学生，斥退怠惰的学生。每有秀才被举荐赴京应试，他都在邺城郊外设宴饯行，并资助财物作为路费。于是相州风气大变，官吏百姓感激悦服，再没有争讼的人。","content_jianti_auto":"岐州刺史安定梁彦光，有惠政，隋主下诏褒美，赐束帛及御伞，以厉天下之吏；久之，徙相州刺史。岐俗质厚，彦光以静镇之，奏课连为天下最。及居相，部如岐州法。邺自齐亡，衣冠士人多迁入关，唯工商乐户移实州郭，风俗险诐，好兴谣讼，目彦光为「著帽饧」。帝闻之，免彦光官。岁余，拜赵州刺史。彦光自请复为相州，帝许之。豪猾闻彦光再来，皆嗤之。彦光至，发擿奸伏，有若神明，豪猾潜窜，阖境大治。于是招致名儒，每鄕立学，亲临策试，褒勤黜怠。及举秀才，祖道于郊，以财物资之。于是风化大变，吏民感悦，无复讼者。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":16909,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十五 (陳紀九) / 高宗宣皇帝下之下 / 太建十三年 / 第 42 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"b36aa0d4-db0e-11ef-94ac-a0d3651f611f","year_int":581},"tongjian_id":"b36aa0d4-db0e-11ef-94ac-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，卽亮翻；下同。稱，尺證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，即亮翻；下同。称，尺证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b3844907-db0e-11ef-b065-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見漢光武紀。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见汉光武纪。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b3844909-db0e-11ef-827b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"梁郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b384490c-db0e-11ef-af8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍丘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍丘县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b384490d-db0e-11ef-8092-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","place_note":"首都长安【陕西西安】","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b384490e-db0e-11ef-8706-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"杞州","place_name_jianti_auto":"杞州","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b384490f-db0e-11ef-a516-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"五代志：梁郡雍丘縣，隋置杞州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"五代志：梁郡雍丘县，隋置杞州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"b384490b-db0e-11ef-a99e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"广阿•河北省汝尧县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3844912-db0e-11ef-a199-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣阿","place_name_jianti_auto":"广阿","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3844913-db0e-11ef-9369-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙州時治廣阿。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵州时治广阿。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"b3844911-db0e-11ef-99d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"今人猶呼割稻爲殺稻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"今人犹呼割稻为杀稻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"b3844914-db0e-11ef-9f6d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"尚，尊也，高也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"尚，尊也，高也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"b3844917-db0e-11ef-8129-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3844919-db0e-11ef-9612-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢置刺史，掌刺舉郡縣吏，故云然。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉置刺史，掌刺举郡县吏，故云然。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":141,"tongjian_id":"b3844918-db0e-11ef-b2c1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"广阿•河北省汝尧县","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"b384491f-db0e-11ef-9c8e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"時刺史多任武將，類不稱職。治書侍御史柳彧上表曰：「昔漢光武與二十八將，披荊棘，定天下，及功成之後，無所任職。伏見詔書，以上柱國和千子爲杞州刺史。千子前任趙州，百姓歌之曰：『老禾不早殺，餘種穢良田。』千子，弓馬武用，是其所長；治民涖衆，非其所解。如謂優老尚年，自可厚賜金帛；若令刺舉，所損殊大。」帝善之。千子竟免。","content_fanyi":"当时隋朝的刺史大多由武将担任，一般都不称职。治书侍御史柳彧上表说：“从前汉光武帝与二十八位将领披荆斩棘，平定天下，等到功业完成之后，没有让这些将领再担任具体官职。我恭读诏书，其中任命上柱国和千子为杞州刺史。和千子先前任赵州刺史时，百姓用歌谣讽刺他说：‘老稻禾不及早割掉，残留的种子会毁坏良田。’和千子骑马射箭等军事才能，是他的长处；治理百姓、统御民众，不是他所懂得的事情。如果说是优待年老、尊崇年长，自然可以多赏赐金银绢帛；如果让他担任刺史、负责监察举荐，造成的损失可就太大了。”隋文帝认为他的意见很好。和千子终于被免职。","content_jianti_auto":"时刺史多任武将，类不称职。治书侍御史柳彧上表曰：「昔汉光武与二十八将，披荆棘，定天下，及功成之后，无所任职。伏见诏书，以上柱国和千子为杞州刺史。千子前任赵州，百姓歌之曰：『老禾不早杀，余种秽良田。』千子，弓马武用，是其所长；治民涖众，非其所解。如谓优老尚年，自可厚赐金帛；若令刺举，所损殊大。」帝善之。千子竟免。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17006,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百七十五 (陳紀九) / 長城公上 / 至德元年 / 第 53 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"b3844906-db0e-11ef-a545-a0d3651f611f","year_int":583},"tongjian_id":"b3844906-db0e-11ef-a545-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fb9-db0e-11ef-b10c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周穆王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周穆王","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fba-db0e-11ef-a1fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"造父","people_name_jianti_auto":"造父","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fbb-db0e-11ef-9016-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"建德","people_name_jianti_auto":"建德","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fbc-db0e-11ef-b691-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"河北省柏乡县","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fbd-db0e-11ef-96b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙城","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵城","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fbe-db0e-11ef-99b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fbf-db0e-11ef-9db4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵郡","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc0-db0e-11ef-b132-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc1-db0e-11ef-8b79-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc2-db0e-11ef-be3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc3-db0e-11ef-a30c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc4-db0e-11ef-8e7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"貝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"贝州","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc5-db0e-11ef-ba07-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fc6-db0e-11ef-b989-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"撫使，疏吏翻。宋白曰：趙州，周穆王封造父於趙城，卽此地。後魏置趙郡，隋大業初置趙州。考異曰：實錄，今年三月建德陷趙州，此又云陷趙州，蓋重複。或三月是貝州。唐統紀唯有九月陷趙州。今從之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"抚使，疏吏翻。宋白曰：赵州，周穆王封造父于赵城，即此地。后魏置赵郡，隋大业初置赵州。考异曰：实录，今年三月建德陷赵州，此又云陷赵州，盖重复。或三月是贝州。唐统纪唯有九月陷赵州。今从之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fb8-db0e-11ef-b7c5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fd0-db0e-11ef-b7ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fd1-db0e-11ef-8afd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、南北朝 隋（卷四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"三年，取济州。既而建德济河，击虏孟海公于周桥[在今山东曹...","context_before":"...化及于聊城[今东昌府附郭县]。寻降隋，隋主侗仍封为夏王。","source_end_index":359,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"df5ef6d1-c056-56b4-bf05-f35553b05637","source_start_index":301,"source_text":"陷唐邢州及沧州，又陷洺州、相州，又陷赵州，陷黎阳，取卫州及滑州[诸州郡详见唐十道诸州。下仿此]。建德还洺州，徙都之。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/四、南北朝 隋（卷四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"82淮安王神通使慰撫使張道源鎭趙州。庚寅，竇建德陷趙州，執總管張志昂及道源。建德以二人及邢州刺史陳君賓不早下，欲殺之，國子祭酒凌敬諫曰：「人臣各爲其主用，彼堅守不下，乃忠臣也。今大王殺之，何以勵羣下乎！」建德怒曰：「吾至城下，彼猶不降，力屈就擒，何可捨也！」敬曰：「今大王殺之，何以勵羣下乎！」建德怒曰：「吾至城下，彼猶不降，力屈就擒，何可捨也！」敬曰：「今大王使大將高士興拒羅藝於易水，藝纔至，興卽降，大王之意以爲何如？」建德乃俉，卽命釋之。","content_fanyi":"淮安王李神通派慰抚使张道源镇守赵州。九月二十五日庚寅，窦建德攻陷赵州，擒获唐总管张志昂和张道源。窦建德因为他们两人以及邢州刺史陈君宾没有尽早归降，准备杀掉他们。国子祭酒凌敬劝谏说：“臣子各自为自己的君主效力，他们坚守城池不投降，这是忠臣啊。如今大王杀掉他们，用什么来激励部下呢！”窦建德发怒说：“我到了城下，他们仍不投降，力量耗尽才被擒，怎么能放过！”凌敬说：“现在大王派大将高士兴在易水抵御罗艺，罗艺刚到城下，高士兴就投降了，大王觉得这怎么样？”窦建德于是醒悟，立即下令释放张志昂和张道源。","content_jianti_auto":"82淮安王神通使慰抚使张道源镇赵州。庚寅，窦建德陷赵州，执总管张志昂及道源。建德以二人及邢州刺史陈君宾不早下，欲杀之，国子祭酒凌敬谏曰：「人臣各为其主用，彼坚守不下，乃忠臣也。今大王杀之，何以励群下乎！」建德怒曰：「吾至城下，彼犹不降，力屈就擒，何可舍也！」敬曰：「今大王杀之，何以励群下乎！」建德怒曰：「吾至城下，彼犹不降，力屈就擒，何可舍也！」敬曰：「今大王使大将高士兴拒罗艺于易水，艺才至，兴即降，大王之意以为何如？」建德乃俉，即命释之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18066,"number":82,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十七 (唐紀三) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝上之下 / 武德二年 / 第 100 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"b6c98fb7-db0e-11ef-9382-a0d3651f611f","year_int":619},"tongjian_id":"b6c98fb7-db0e-11ef-9382-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b74fc196-db0e-11ef-803c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏州","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b74fc197-db0e-11ef-a7cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘县","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b74fc198-db0e-11ef-83fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘州","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘州","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b74fc199-db0e-11ef-88c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏州","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b74fc19a-db0e-11ef-90f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b74fc19b-db0e-11ef-88b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨黃","place_name_jianti_auto":"临黄","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b74fc19c-db0e-11ef-a48d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"武阳","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b74fc19d-db0e-11ef-b2e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博州","place_name_jianti_auto":"博州","place_note":"山东省聊城市","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"b74fc19e-db0e-11ef-91bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武水","place_name_jianti_auto":"武水","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"b74fc19f-db0e-11ef-b5f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘州","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘州","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b74fc1a0-db0e-11ef-ac8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"業州","place_name_jianti_auto":"业州","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"b74fc1a1-db0e-11ef-9e8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘州","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘州","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"b74fc1a2-db0e-11ef-87cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘县","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"b74fc1a3-db0e-11ef-a0d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莘州","place_name_jianti_auto":"莘州","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"b74fc1a4-db0e-11ef-8c26-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋開皇十六年，以魏州之莘縣置莘州，大業初廢。是年，復以魏州之莘、臨黃、武陽，博州之武水置莘州。考異曰：實錄作「華州」，新書作「業州」。按地里志無業州，必莘州也。十道志：開皇十六年於莘縣置莘州。舊志，武德五年置。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋开皇十六年，以魏州之莘县置莘州，大业初废。是年，复以魏州之莘、临黄、武阳，博州之武水置莘州。考异曰：实录作「华州」，新书作「业州」。按地里志无业州，必莘州也。十道志：开皇十六年于莘县置莘州。旧志，武德五年置。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b74ec0cc-db0e-11ef-882f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b74fc1ae-db0e-11ef-a4bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/七、大名府（卷十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"南唐得魏州，亦为重镇。迨安史倡乱，河北之患，二百余年，而...","context_before":"...李密，请改为魏州，又请西取魏郡。密从之，而军声振于河朔。","source_end_index":194,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6d46b47b-0300-5037-98b1-d02f407124b8","source_start_index":170,"source_text":"窦建德及刘黑闼皆有问鼎中原之志，辄争魏州以临河。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/七、大名府（卷十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"79己巳，劉黑闥陷邢州、趙州；庚午，陷魏州，殺總管潘道毅；辛未，陷莘州。","content_fanyi":"己巳日，刘黑闼攻下邢州、赵州；庚午日，攻下魏州，斩杀总管潘道毅；辛未日，攻下莘州。","content_jianti_auto":"79己巳，刘黑闼陷邢州、赵州；庚午，陷魏州，杀总管潘道毅；辛未，陷莘州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18312,"number":79,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十九 (唐紀五) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝中之中 / 武德四年 / 第 107 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"b74ec0cb-db0e-11ef-b945-a0d3651f611f","year_int":621},"tongjian_id":"b74ec0cb-db0e-11ef-b945-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春來冰薄，履之則有陷溺之懼。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春来冰薄，履之则有陷溺之惧。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b88ddb29-db0e-11ef-a34c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"無忌","people_name_jianti_auto":"无忌","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b88ddb30-db0e-11ef-b035-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"沖","people_name_jianti_auto":"冲","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b88ddb31-db0e-11ef-92ef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"主嫁無忌子沖。樂，音洛。","note_content_jianti_auto":"主嫁无忌子冲。乐，音洛。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":185,"tongjian_id":"b88ddb2f-db0e-11ef-8627-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b88ddb27-db0e-11ef-b9a3-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"juān","source_anchor_text":"罷侯置守蠲除曩弊深","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":88,"text":"蠲","tongjian_id":"c4947a6d-ee7a-5940-8e0b-36684decc497"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"河北省赵县","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b88e05b4-db0e-11ef-bab4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"會司空、趙州刺史長孫無忌等皆不願之國，上表固讓，稱：「承恩以來，形影相弔，若履春冰；宗族憂虞，如置湯火。緬惟三代封建，蓋由力不能制，因而利之，禮樂節文，多非己出。兩漢罷侯置守，蠲除曩弊，深協事宜。今因臣等，復有變更，恐紊聖朝綱紀；且後世愚幼不肖之嗣，或抵冒邦憲，自取誅夷，更因延世之賞，致成勦絕之禍，良可哀愍。願停渙汗之旨，賜其性命之恩。」無忌又因子婦長樂公主固請於上，且言「臣披荊棘事陛下，今海內寧一，柰何棄之外州，與遷徙何異！」上曰：「割地以封功臣，古今通義，意欲公之後嗣，輔朕子孫，共傳永久；而公等乃復發言怨望，朕豈強公等以茅土邪！」庚子，詔停世封刺史。","content_fanyi":"正好这时，司空、赵州刺史长孙无忌等人都不愿前去各州就任刺史，上表执意辞让，说：“自从承受皇恩以来，臣形影相吊，如履薄冰；全宗族的人忧虑恐惧，如同置身于汤火之中。追想夏、商、周三代实行分封诸侯国，大概是由于天子力量不足以控制整个天下，因而分封诸侯以利于天子控制天下，礼乐仪式制度，大多不是由诸侯自己决定的。到了两汉废除诸侯国、设置郡县守令，革除了从前的弊病，深合事理。如今因为臣等，又要加以改变，恐怕会扰乱圣朝纲纪；况且后世愚幼无知的不肖子孙，或许有人触犯国家法令，自取诛灭，反而因为延及后世承袭官职的赏赐，招致被剿灭的灾祸，实在值得哀怜。希望陛下停止让子孙世袭刺史的诏旨，赐给臣等保全性命的皇恩。”长孙无忌又让他的儿媳长乐公主极力向唐太宗请求，并且说：“臣披荆斩棘事奉陛下，如今海内安宁统一，为何把我抛弃到京城之外的州郡，与降级左迁有什么不同！”太宗说：“分割土地来封赏功臣，是古今通义，朕的本意是想让你的后代辅佐朕的子孙，共同传承到永久；可是你们却又出言表示怨恨不满，朕难道是拿封地强逼你们吗！”二月二十七日庚子，朝廷下诏停止世封刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"会司空、赵州刺史长孙无忌等皆不愿之国，上表固让，称：「承恩以来，形影相吊，若履春冰；宗族忧虞，如置汤火。缅惟三代封建，盖由力不能制，因而利之，礼乐节文，多非己出。两汉罢侯置守，蠲除曩弊，深协事宜。今因臣等，复有变更，恐紊圣朝纲纪；且后世愚幼不肖之嗣，或抵冒邦宪，自取诛夷，更因延世之赏，致成勦绝之祸，良可哀愍。愿停涣汗之旨，赐其性命之恩。」无忌又因子妇长乐公主固请于上，且言「臣披荆棘事陛下，今海内宁一，柰何弃之外州，与迁徙何异！」上曰：「割地以封功臣，古今通义，意欲公之后嗣，辅朕子孙，共传永久；而公等乃复发言怨望，朕岂强公等以茅土邪！」庚子，诏停世封刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，足以达人情矣。夫人之情，俾其子孙世有其土，世役其民，席...","context_before":"","source_end_index":32,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"11e2ed64-2d60-4ee6-9f77-8fac4aa423ec","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"太宗以荆王元景、长孙无忌等为诸州刺史，子孙世袭，而无忌等不愿受封"},{"context_after":"强人而授之国，为天下嗤而已矣，恶足辩？","context_before":"...者犹竞起而与争；勿庸争也，试使之行焉，而自信以必行否也？","source_end_index":206,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a9418c5c-fea4-4e1d-a470-70d0aa1f5d14","source_start_index":175,"source_text":"太宗曰：“割地以封功臣，古今通义，而公薄之，岂强公以茅土邪？”"}],"title":"一五 不可强迫臣下接受封土"}],"id":19034,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百九十五 (唐紀十一) / 太宗文武大聖大廣孝皇帝中之上 / 十三年 / 第 9 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b88ddb27-db0e-11ef-b9a3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":639},"tongjian_id":"b88ddb27-db0e-11ef-b9a3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"河北省赵县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf547-db0e-11ef-a460-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf548-db0e-11ef-9ee7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf549-db0e-11ef-9832-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"舊志：趙州至京師東北一千八百四十二里，東都一千三十三里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"旧志：赵州至京师东北一千八百四十二里，东都一千三十三里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf546-db0e-11ef-beac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：舊紀、傳，新紀、表、傳，皆作「鄜州」，統紀作「瀛州」。實錄、唐曆作「麟州」，今從之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：旧纪、传，新纪、表、传，皆作「鄜州」，统纪作「瀛州」。实录、唐历作「麟州」，今从之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf54b-db0e-11ef-a10c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"麟州","place_name_jianti_auto":"麟州","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf556-db0e-11ef-b657-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf557-db0e-11ef-aa0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"松州都督府","place_name_jianti_auto":"松州都督府","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf558-db0e-11ef-a980-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"溱州","place_name_jianti_auto":"溱州","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf559-db0e-11ef-ac54-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"黔州都督府","place_name_jianti_auto":"黔州都督府","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55a-db0e-11ef-b650-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"溱州","place_name_jianti_auto":"溱州","place_note":"重庆市綦江县东南","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55b-db0e-11ef-8209-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55c-db0e-11ef-b62d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55d-db0e-11ef-834a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"貞觀五年置麟州以處生羌，屬松州都督府；十六年開山洞置溱州，屬黔州都督府。舊志：溱州至京師三千四百八十里，東都四千二百里。溱，側詵翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贞观五年置麟州以处生羌，属松州都督府；十六年开山洞置溱州，属黔州都督府。旧志：溱州至京师三千四百八十里，东都四千二百里。溱，侧诜翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf555-db0e-11ef-865e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"集州","place_name_jianti_auto":"集州","place_note":"四川省南江县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf560-db0e-11ef-8479-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf561-db0e-11ef-a6cd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf562-db0e-11ef-bd4b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"綏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绥州","place_note":"陕西省绥德县","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf563-db0e-11ef-9ffe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf564-db0e-11ef-8b43-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf565-db0e-11ef-9574-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"舊志：集州，京師西南一千四百二十五里，至東都二千六百里。綏州，京師東北一千里，至東都一千八百一十九里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"旧志：集州，京师西南一千四百二十五里，至东都二千六百里。绥州，京师东北一千里，至东都一千八百一十九里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf55f-db0e-11ef-8366-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"河北省赵县","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf570-db0e-11ef-80a3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2周允元與司刑少卿皇甫文備奏內史豆盧欽望、同平章事韋巨源、杜景儉、蘇味道、陸元方附會李昭德，不能匡正，欽望貶趙州，巨源貶麟州，景儉貶溱州，味道貶集州，元方貶綏州刺史。","content_fanyi":"周允元和司刑少卿皇甫文备上疏弹劾内史豆卢钦望、同平章事韦巨源、杜景俭、苏味道、陆元方依附李昭德，没有尽到匡正补救的职责，豆卢钦望降职为赵州刺史，韦巨源降职为麟州刺史，杜景俭降职为溱州刺史，苏味道降职为集州刺史，陆元方降职为绥州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"2周允元与司刑少卿皇甫文备奏内史豆卢钦望、同平章事韦巨源、杜景俭、苏味道、陆元方附会李昭德，不能匡正，钦望贬赵州，巨源贬麟州，景俭贬溱州，味道贬集州，元方贬绥州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20361,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百五 (唐紀二十一) / 則天順聖皇后中之上 / 天冊萬歲元年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"ba6cf545-db0e-11ef-8af3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":695},"tongjian_id":"ba6cf545-db0e-11ef-8af3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"丹將，卽亮翻；下同。騎，奇寄翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"丹将，即亮翻；下同。骑，奇寄翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"ba8cfb49-db0e-11ef-836b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","place_note":"河北省赵县","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"ba8cfb4f-db0e-11ef-9476-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"ba8f4516-db0e-11ef-a57f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"15武懿宗軍至趙州，聞契丹將駱務整數千騎將至冀州，懿宗懼，欲南遁。或曰：「虜無輜重，以抄掠爲資，苦按兵拒守，勢必離散，從而擊之，可有大功。」懿宗不從，退據相州，委棄軍資器仗甚衆。契丹遂屠趙州。","content_fanyi":"武懿宗率军到达赵州，听说契丹部将骆务整率领数千骑兵即将进抵冀州，武懿宗恐惧，想向南逃跑。有人建议说：“敌人没有辎重，靠抢掠作为给养，如果按兵拒守，势必离散，乘势攻击，可以建立大功。”武懿宗不听从，退守相州，抛弃了大量军用物资和兵器。契丹随后屠戮了赵州城。","content_jianti_auto":"15武懿宗军至赵州，闻契丹将骆务整数千骑将至冀州，懿宗惧，欲南遁。或曰：「虏无辎重，以抄掠为资，苦按兵拒守，势必离散，从而击之，可有大功。」懿宗不从，退据相州，委弃军资器仗甚众。契丹遂屠赵州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20430,"number":15,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百六 (唐紀二十二) / 則天順聖皇后中之下 / 神功元年 / 第 30 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"ba8cfb48-db0e-11ef-b1bf-a0d3651f611f","year_int":697},"tongjian_id":"ba8cfb48-db0e-11ef-b1bf-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"趙州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bb90a948-db0e-11ef-b160-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『張：「蹋」下脫「歌」字。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『张：「蹋」下脱「歌」字。』","note_type":"『張：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bb90a947-db0e-11ef-9567-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bb90a946-db0e-11ef-9435-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲，于僞翻。蹋歌者，連手而歌，蹋地以爲節。萬歲樂，歌曲之名。樂，音洛。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为，于伪翻。蹋歌者，连手而歌，蹋地以为节。万岁乐，歌曲之名。乐，音洛。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"bb90a949-db0e-11ef-a8b4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙州","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵州","resolved_place_entity_id":660,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"bb90a94e-db0e-11ef-b303-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"默啜使閻知微招諭趙州，知微與虜連手蹋萬歲樂於城下。將軍陳令英在城上謂曰：「尚書位任非輕，乃爲虜蹋歌，獨無慙乎！」知微微吟曰：「不得已，萬歲樂。」","content_fanyi":"阿史那默啜派遣阎知微去招降并晓示赵州城中的官民，阎知微与突厥人在城下拉着手、踏着节拍唱《万岁乐》。将军陈令英在城上对他说：“尚书职责不轻，竟然为敌人踏歌，难道不感到惭愧吗？”阎知微低声吟唱道：“不得已，《万岁乐》。”","content_jianti_auto":"默啜使阎知微招谕赵州，知微与虏连手蹋万岁乐于城下。将军陈令英在城上谓曰：「尚书位任非轻，乃为虏蹋歌，独无慙乎！」知微微吟曰：「不得已，万岁乐。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":20472,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百六 (唐紀二十二) / 則天順聖皇后中之下 / 聖曆元年 / 第 25 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"bb90a945-db0e-11ef-b0a9-a0d3651f611f","year_int":698},"tongjian_id":"bb90a945-db0e-11ef-b0a9-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":5,"total_paragraphs":49},"place_name":"趙州"},"message":"success","success":true}